    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "A two-cavity Klystron amplifier has the following parameters:"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\n\\mathrm { V } _ { 0 } = 1 2 0 0 \\mathrm { V } ,\\tag{10}\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\n\\mathrm { R } _ { 0 } = 5 0 \\mathrm { k } \\Omega\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\n\\mathrm { I } _ { 0 } = 2 5 \\mathrm { m A } ,\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\n\\mathrm { f } = 3 \\mathrm { G H z } ,\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Gap Spacing in either cavity: $\\mathbf { d } = 1$ mm"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Spacing between centres of cavities: $\\mathrm { L } = 5$ cm"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Effective shunt impedance: $\\mathrm { R } _ { \\mathrm { s h } } = 3 0 \\mathrm { k } \\Omega$"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(i) Find the input gap voltage to give maximum voltage $\\mathrm { V } _ { 2 }$ ."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(ii) Calculate gain neglecting the beam loading."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "(iii) Find out the efficiency of the amplifier."
    }
